            "description": {
              "content": "Returns a collection of timesheets (aggregate approval records) for the given organization.\n\nResults can be filtered by date[start]/[stop], approved[start], and status.\n\nNote: Timesheets are aggregate records used by the timesheet approval system, not individual time entries.",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
